			Start your Angular or React application.			
			Open the application in Chrome.
			Open Chrome DevTools using F12.
			Navigate to the Lighthouse tab.
			Select Accessibility.
			Select the Desktop or Mobile device mode.
			Click Analyze page load.
			Review the accessibility findings.
			Fix the reported problems.
			Run the audit again.

