Q. how to create microfrontend architecture?
A. for microfronted application, Its required 1 shell application and other are child application. 
	application can be in any tech like angular, react.js, vue.js
	1. React application – React 19.
	2. Angular application – Angular 20.
	3. Root application (Shell) – Responsible for loading and managing both applications

1. create angular workspace
  npx @angular/cli@20 new angular-mfe --no-create-application

2. create angular applications
  ng generate application shell --routing --style=scss 
  ng generate application loan --routing --style=scss 
  ng generate application disbursal --routing --style=scss 
  ng generate application reports --routing --style=scss 

3. Install module federation
  ng add @angular-architects/module-federation@^20 --project shell --type host --port 4200
  ng add @angular-architects/module-federation@^20 --project loan --type remote --port 4201
